    "StartPoints": {
      "85e0021ff979b29d2c1828d1": 0
    },
    "localization": {
      "en": {
        "a41f9b86201dd52f244d72e4": "You deal with transport, right? Any chance you've got a boat? I need to reach a ship out in the gulf.",
        "ca74addc73896b98dd3bc547": "Nah man. I barely got this BTR back on its feet, no time for boats.",
        "455a62e8fac83e882e9a120e": "You know anyone who could help?",
        "2a140af5cd2f70ea78a58fce": "Picked up some parts from smugglers before, they've got all kinds of junk lying around. Might have something that floats too.",
        "f28b6edea7c204770b5656c2": "Can you put me in touch with them?",
        "f8b7a5ee175790a5a65e9aba": "They don't usually deal with your kind. But I can ask around.",
        "19bfdadfdf8e4777db7a4fcc": "And you'd do that just like that?",
        "9e52ccadbdccc7953658b1b2": "Relax man, I'll be heading that way anyway. But you could do something to improve your chances.",
        "262eb1a40835df2487c9537d": "What do you need?",
        "766e2561d8263f85e2143554": "They've got a stash where too many outsiders have been showing up lately. You clear out those guests, I'll let the smugglers know it was you who helped.",
        "79a3e9bc403151fb8c726146": "Alright. Where is this camp?",
        "f5e3f60b6b57a9ea7ac15a00": "Not right now.",
        "c0131602379e485fd9381c7a": "North of the port terminal, around where the health resort is.",
        "dbe0813dd108b09abe59cf8e": "How do I find it exactly?",
        "bfe294c1a68d37e8f7f9a6f4": "Got it. When should I expect to hear back from you?",
        "887498f86c2a8375dbc07406": "Go down from the resort toward customs, there's a big open field. Past that you'll see a few hangars with shipping containers.",
        "72d4c21fa6a1f6c0687e40d3": "By the time you're done and back, I'll have info for you.",
        "00b996ec3406e285a100ffde": "Still working on that camp.",
        "6931762844407b69803fd1d2": "I cleared the smugglers' camp. Did you talk to them?",
        "0684e3edf924ea3656654dce": "Yeah. And if it wasn't for you, they wouldn't have even bothered talking.",
        "d8858d7a6d88bcfaa8726583": "So they're ready to provide transport?",
        "f4bddcebb848d668bb984980": "Yup. They've got a hovercraft. They'll pick you up from the coast. But there's a catch.",
        "1949efb2f9d7e3c3f9929c24": "Not gonna be free?",
        "8373ef8beead45b863ed9b3e": "That's not a catch, that's just how business works around here! I mean something else.",
        "addf64347ee5c9e5306592bd": "What's the problem then?",
        "6bc455c297f2a5b4981790e1": "They need that craft in a lot of places, and nobody knows what's waiting on that ship of yours. So they're only willing to drop you off, not pick you back up.",
        "e3f240925e2cb6716066ea66": "And how is that supposed to help me?",
        "0682e136a59e0ec6dad0527f": "Call it what you want. They're not sticking around while you poke through every corner out there. Those are the terms, and you're not getting a better deal right now.",
        "6cd54f4932b23510e1b51d96": "So I'll have to find another way to exfil from the ship.",
        "199b4227df7dd6aa46d59373": "Yeah. But they won't screw you on the insertion, don't worry. When you're ready, head to the shore, find the hovercraft, and bring cash."
      }
    }
  }
]